If you die after the age of 75 we can pay the full value of your remaining pension fund to your nominated beneficiaries, at the discretion of the trustees. Any benefits will be taxed at your beneficiaries' marginal rate. The payment of a lump sum will be subject to a tax charge. The amount of the charge will either be:
